 The changelog can be found on the [releases page](https://github.com/openai/codex/releases).
+
+## FoldGPT auxiliary engine — unreleased
+
+- Separate controller configuration from provider-owned project TOML layers for
+  app-server config/read, preserving provenance, precedence and trust. Provider
+  discovery/canonicalization failures abort the read; captured project text stays
+  available for diagnostics. Resolve public feature flags from that same provider
+  snapshot. Thread ConfigBuilder routing remains a later stage.
+- Connect a trusted, already-authenticated local runtime to effective app-server
+  startup through a Rust-only bootstrap value, preserving ordinary startup and
+  refusing incompatible configuration without fallback. Full thread configuration
+  routing and Android activation remain unimplemented.
+- Resolve injected local runtime metadata and shell from the provider, preserve
+  missing optional metadata, and refuse failed metadata or unknown shells without
+  controller fallback. Select the reported executable and keep controller V1
+  snapshot launches off that runtime; Android snapshots and activation remain open.
+- Recognize reported Android command semantics as POSIX without changing unknown
+  platform handling or the selected runtime's enforcement policy.
+- Add an injectable real local execution/filesystem runtime with separate sandbox
+  ownership and controller path visibility, without changing remote identity.
+- Route model unified execution and apply-patch sandbox intent to the selected
+  runtime and preserve required-policy refusals.
+- Add a bounded owned-process output/control adapter and PC integration tests.
+- Allow native providers to supply exclusively owned, bounded process events
+  without a mandatory broadcast hop; verify real child output under backpressure.
+- Connect an authenticated fixed ExecServer transport as the real local runtime,
+  preserving full sandbox context and reporting disconnection without replay or
+  synthetic native completion. Verify Rust-to-Python-to-native execution on PC.
+- Record incomplete Android bootstrap and host filesystem routes in
+  `FOLDGPT-INTEGRATION.md`; no phone activation is included.
