+## Release lockfile normalization
+
+The exact upstream release tag has workspace version `0.153.4` but retains `0.0.0`
+for 149 workspace packages in `Cargo.lock`. Cargo 1.95 refuses `--locked` until
+those local package versions are synchronized. The generated change is confined
+to those version lines: no registry/git package version, checksum or dependency
+list changes. Keep this mechanical normalization separate from runtime changes.
